    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Danish multidisciplinary graphic and motion designer based in Nottingham, UK; trades as his own practice (jonathannielsen.studio). Focus on bold visual identities with animation, across print, environmental and digital. Clients include University of the Arts London, Art Fund, Berliner Philharmoniker, SPYSCAPE, Atomico, Carl Nielsen Museet. Credited as Design Assistant and Motion at FUHR Studio on Carl Nielsen Museet identity (2022); credited as Motion Design alongside Richard Coldicott on Berliner Philharmoniker rebrand by Studio Oliver Helfrich (2021). Own motion and type piece A Rebel City in Motion shown at Nottingham Light Night 2022 and featured in Slanted Magazine no.40 (Experimental Type). Mid-to-senior; Autonomy 4 (solo practitioner with named client credits at external studios, inferred). Own site 503 at time of scrape; best work captured from FUHR Studio case study (Carl Nielsen Museet identity system) and YouTube (Rebel City). IG @jonathanmnielsen queued to state/ig-queue.json for logged-in grab (headless scrape blocked; 660 posts). LinkedIn /jonathan-m-nielsen verified via web search.",
